# Package manager: Bun

This project uses **Bun**. Do not use `npm`, `npx`, or `pnpm` unless the user explicitly asks.

## Commands

| Instead of | Use |
|------------|-----|
| `npm install` | `bun install` |
| `npm install <pkg>` | `bun add <pkg>` |
| `npm install -D <pkg>` | `bun add -d <pkg>` |
| `npm uninstall <pkg>` | `bun remove <pkg>` |
| `npm run <script>` | `bun run <script>` or `bun <script>` |
| `npx <cmd>` | `bunx <cmd>` |
| `npm ci` | `bun install --frozen-lockfile` |

## Notes

- Lockfile is `bun.lock`; keep it in sync when adding or removing dependencies.
- Prefer `bun` for one-off scripts and tooling in this repo.
